  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.91 - AM041 respects independent MapperConfiguration containers\n- Registering the same type pair in two separate MapperConfiguration instances is no longer reported as a duplicate; AutoMapper accepts it and both mappers work\n- Found by scanning a third-party AutoMapper consumer, where this shape produced seventeen false positives\n- Duplicates inside one MapperConfiguration or one Profile still report\n- No rule ID or severity changes",
